# Parallel by default (many hands)

Doctrine: **Many hands lightens the load.** Prefer many non-overlapping tickets at once over serial one-at-a-time.

## Allowed in parallel
- Block A worker (TC pages) + Block B (ISI) + Claude docs + social AI + Angie clicks + Daniel keys/media
- Multiple Claude tickets in different chats (whitepaper, social, governance, membership) as long as topics do not overlap
- Lead writing tickets while worker applies pages

## Forbidden in parallel
- Two agents on the same hub family / same page IDs
- Two agents editing Additional CSS
- Claude + anyone both drafting the same post
- Lead applying Office while worker is assigned Office

## Lead duty every session
1. Keep `docs/COMMAND-OS.md` Current assignment filled with **many** READY tickets
2. Point Daniel to `docs/SWARM-LAUNCH-PACK.md` for paste targets
3. Do not wait for one lane to finish before teeing the next non-overlapping lane
